### Run Agent through Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/agent/run
X-Api-Key: dev-demo-key
X-Request-Id: agent-e2e-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "检索审计追踪和记录保存要求，引用证据后回答",
  "session_id": "debug-session-001",
  "max_steps": 6,
  "metadata": {"business": "enterprise-assistant"}
}

### Start canary after an existing Judge Run passed
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/releases
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeName": "deepseek-v4-flash",
  "canaryTarget": "qwen:qwen-plus",
  "judgeRunId": "replace-with-judge-run-id",
  "canaryPercent": 5
}

### Monitor and automatically promote/rollback
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/releases/replace-with-release-id/monitor
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### Manual rollback
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/releases/replace-with-release-id/rollback
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"manual rollback during verification"}
